          "quote": "如亥月己丑日占將來有官否。得兌化訟卦"
        },
        {
          "paragraphId": "zengshan-buyi:L0381-L0381",
          "file": "sources/fulltext/divination/zengshan-buyi/fulltext.md",
          "startLine": 381,
          "endLine": 381,
          "quote": "父母未土ㄨ世 父母戌土⚊"
        },
        {
          "paragraphId": "zengshan-buyi:L0383-L0383",
          "file": "sources/fulltext/divination/zengshan-buyi/fulltext.md",
          "startLine": 383,
          "endLine": 383,
          "quote": "兄弟酉金⚊  兄弟申金⚊"
        },
        {
          "paragraphId": "zengshan-buyi:L0385-L0385",
          "file": "sources/fulltext/divination/zengshan-buyi/fulltext.md",
          "startLine": 385,
          "endLine": 385,
          "quote": "子孫亥水⚊  官鬼午火⚊"
        },
        {
          "paragraphId": "zengshan-buyi:L0387-L0387",
          "file": "sources/fulltext/divination/zengshan-buyi/fulltext.md",
          "startLine": 387,
          "endLine": 387,
          "quote": "父母丑土⚋應 官鬼午火⚋"
        },
        {
          "paragraphId": "zengshan-buyi:L0389-L0389",
          "file": "sources/fulltext/divination/zengshan-buyi/fulltext.md",
          "startLine": 389,
          "endLine": 389,
          "quote": "妻財卯木⚊  父母辰土⚊"
        },
        {
          "paragraphId": "zengshan-buyi:L0391-L0391",
          "file": "sources/fulltext/divination/zengshan-buyi/fulltext.md",
          "startLine": 391,
          "endLine": 391,
          "quote": "官鬼巳火○  妻財寅木⚋"
        },
        {
          "paragraphId": "zengshan-buyi:L0393-L0393",
          "file": "sources/fulltext/divination/zengshan-buyi/fulltext.md",
          "startLine": 393,
          "endLine": 393,
          "quote": "此卦官動而生世﹐世動化進神﹐𨿽然有官之象﹐但官逢月破﹐世遇旬空﹐然空者猶月日辰相沖﹐沖空則實不爲空矣﹐而破者又無日辰動爻之生﹐占以日建亦生不起﹐況無日建動爻以生乎﹖予疑之卽無所用﹐何故動而生世﹖命之再占﹐又得出水地比卦。"
        },
        {
          "paragraphId": "zengshan-buyi:L0407-L0407",
          "file": "sources/fulltext/divination/zengshan-buyi/fulltext.md",
          "startLine": 407,
          "endLine": 407,
          "quote": "斷曰﹕命若無官﹐官不得生世持世﹐今卽前卦動。官相生﹐後得官臨世位﹐食祿王家終須有日。彼問﹕應在何年﹖予曰﹕前卦官臨月破﹐定於實破之年﹐果於巳年承襲長房世職﹐若以月破﹐百無所用﹐霄壤之隔也。"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
